      ],
      "source": "https://www.daftertownship.org/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first post office opened in January 1879 under the name Stevensburgh, with George Stevens as its inaugural postmaster.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
